        "detailed_description": "<h1>💚💚 MORE UPCOMING GAMES! 💚💚</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/bc7f6cd22ff892eb657e4efc6fbbac28.poster.avif?t=1788074910\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/bc7f6cd22ff892eb657e4efc6fbbac28.webm?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/bc7f6cd22ff892eb657e4efc6fbbac28.mp4?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Think you're good at spotting images and solving captchas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join Doma, a curious little cat who's just started training to become a detective!<br>Help Doma tackle picture-matching challenges to show your skills and catch naughty Oyen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/3f6c912ee660f7abd9b156dbd439d351.poster.avif?t=1788074910\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/3f6c912ee660f7abd9b156dbd439d351.webm?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/3f6c912ee660f7abd9b156dbd439d351.mp4?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A short game, simple and quick gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/4b98be670725fe5e916cea81bfb7ae80.poster.avif?t=1788074910\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/4b98be670725fe5e916cea81bfb7ae80.webm?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/4b98be670725fe5e916cea81bfb7ae80.mp4?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">12 photo categories to explore, with 9 fun photos in each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.poster.avif?t=1788074910\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.webm?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.mp4?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete the tasks and collect the items stolen by Oyen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Looking for a challenge? Try the sepia mode!<br>Mastered all the photos? Test your speed in timer mode and set a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.poster.avif?t=1788074910\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.webm?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.mp4?t=1788074910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
